<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GSTAAD, Switzerland 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results</p>
<p>from the Swiss Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat 2-Alex Corretja (Spain) 3-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-4</p>
</text>
